 "note": "M, 15 platforms, open, inward. Three lanes. The top lane is a conveyor flowing toward B (x1.5 with it, x0.5 against), the bottom lane one flowing toward A: each player starts with a fast attack lane and a slow one. The conveyor tower sits on the middle platform every lane meets; firing it flips both lanes, so whoever holds the centre picks which side attacks fast. Point-symmetric. Survivor ring: the centre, the middle road and both crossings.",
